# Aethelgard protocol

Before non-trivial work, read in order:

1. `docs/PHASE.md`
2. `docs/process/global-prompt.md`
3. `docs/process/rules.md`
4. `docs/process/step-procedure.md`
5. `docs/process/quality.md`
6. `docs/project/session.md` (reconcile — torn Step ⇒ rollback)
7. `docs/project/goals.md` + active Goal
8. `docs/project/project.md`
9. `docs/navigation.md`

## Rules

- Docs win over chat
- Scope: `docs/project/project.md` only unless expanded in docs first
- No code before user approval of job + FRs; store FRs in `docs/blockers/F-0xx.md` before MARK/code
- Mark Step `in progress` before code; torn progress ⇒ rollback
- Witness: full incremental suite (this Step + all prior Steps) — markdown is not Accept
- Sync docs at end of Step per `docs/doc-contract.md` + SYNC checklist in `docs/process/step-procedure.md` (entry points, banners, glossary — not FR greps alone); commit after final check when green
- Do not Accept if Active Goal entry points disagree with `docs/project/goals.md`
- Explain in clear English what changed and what it means

